---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

const stats = [
  { key: "about.stat.1", val: "about.stat.1v", icon: "lucide:calendar" },
  { key: "about.stat.2", val: "about.stat.2v", icon: "lucide:clock" },
  { key: "about.stat.3", val: "about.stat.3v", icon: "lucide:map-pin" },
  { key: "about.stat.4", val: "about.stat.4v", icon: "lucide:layers" },
];
---

<section class="section" id="sobremi">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-visual reveal-left">
        <div class="about-code-bg">
          <div class="about-hero-icon">
            <Icon name="lucide:terminal" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-glitch-text">
            <span class="glitch-line">&gt; <span class="glitch-cmd">whoami</span></span>
            <span class="glitch-line glitch-result" id="glitchResult">facundo</span>
            <span class="glitch-line glitch-cursor">_</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-quote">
          <Icon name="lucide:quote" class="quote-icon" />
          <blockquote data-i18n="about.desc2">
            Creo firmemente en el poder de la autoeducación y la práctica constante. Cada línea de código es una oportunidad para aprender algo nuevo y mejorar como profesional.
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content reveal-right">
        <span class="sec-tag" data-i18n="about.tag" style="border-color: rgba(139,92,246,0.12); color: #8b5cf6; background: rgba(139,92,246,0.08);">Sobre mí</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title">
          <span data-i18n="about.title">Conoce más</span><br />
          <span class="gradient-text" data-i18n="about.title.highlight" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #f472b6); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;">sobre mí</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="about-text">
          <p data-i18n="about.desc1">
            Soy Facundo, desarrollador web autodidacta de Argentina. Tengo 19 años y más de 2 años de experiencia en el rubro. Arranqué por curiosidad y terminé aprendiendo por mi cuenta, haciendo proyectos reales y metiéndome tanto en frontend como en backend.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-stats stagger">
          {stats.map((s) => (
            <div class="about-stat-card">
              <div class="about-stat-icon">
                <Icon name={s.icon} />
              </div>
              <div class="about-stat-body">
                <span class="about-stat-val" data-i18n={s.val}>19</span>
                <span class="about-stat-label" data-i18n={s.key}>Años</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-visual {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .about-code-bg {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 36px 32px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 220px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .about-code-bg::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 40%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04), transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about-hero-icon {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }

  .about-hero-icon :global(svg) {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  .about-glitch-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .glitch-line {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .glitch-cmd {
    color: var(--accent-2);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .glitch-result {
    color: #34d399;
    padding-left: 24px;
    animation: glitchReveal 0.5s ease-out;
  }

  .glitch-cursor {
    padding-left: 24px;
    animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    50% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  .about-quote {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .quote-icon {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .about-quote blockquote {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .about-stat-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .about-stat-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .about-stat-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .about-stat-icon :global(svg) {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  .about-stat-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1px;
  }

  .about-stat-val {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-stat-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .about-stats {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about-stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about-text p {
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .about-code-bg {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
